{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Come, let me advise you.</b> Some say the matter concerns the daughters of Moab, and this is far-fetched, because he said, \"in the end of days.\" The correct view in my eyes is that it is according to its plain sense: I will give you counsel, that you may know what to do, for this people will thus do to your people."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:17.564629793Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}